@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il30-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-60a2-renewed-kibbutz-member`

-- Tests for s 60A(b)(2). Expected values read from the section: income reported to the kibbutz is assessed under the section; income not reported is
-- assessed apart, and the credit points, the rates and the losses of the kibbutz's assessment are left out.

§ `Tests of section 60A(b)(2)`

#ASSERT `s 60A(b) — the member's income is assessed` TRUE EQUALS `under the sub-chapter on the kibbutz and its members`
#ASSERT `s 60A(b) — the member's income is assessed` FALSE EQUALS `apart from that sub-chapter, the rates and credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment and the kibbutz's losses not being counted`
#ASSERT `s 60A(b)(2) — the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 60A(b)(2) — the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 60A(b)(2) — the rates counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 60A(b)(2) — the rates counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 60A(b)(2) — the kibbutz's losses are left out of the member's assessment of income` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 60A(b)(2) — the kibbutz's losses are left out of the member's assessment of income` TRUE
